This setting of the 105CA is centered on 29.500 MHz
for OSCAR satellite and FM operation.  It has a 2:1
VSWR band-width of 1000 KHz centered on 29.500.
Maximum gain is 8.35 dBd and maximum F/B is 27 dB.

Beta rod length= 17 inches (measured from inside 
tubing edge to outside edge of clamp).  Pigtail
length= 7 inches.  Balun= Hy-Gain BN-4000 (current
type)

Radiation patterns and VSWR were verified in September
1991.  9-18-91  RC


